In Hono with Neon serverless driver, you should use the `@neondatabase/serverless` connection pooler over WebSockets with explicit timeouts:

```typescript
import { Pool } from '@neondatabase/serverless';

export const pool = new Pool({
  connectionString: env.DATABASE_URL,
  max: 10,
  idleTimeoutMillis: 30000,
});
```

This prevents ephemeral instances from exhausting the server pool quota.
